<!--
  Entitlements applied by darwin-sign-and-notarize.sh via codesign --entitlements.

  Today: a CLI signed with hardened runtime, no extra capabilities. The empty
  dict here is intentional and is enough to keep notarytool happy.

  Future Tauri + FinderSync GUI seam: the .app bundle and the FinderSync
  extension will need their own entitlements files (com.apple.security.app-sandbox,
  com.apple.developer.FinderSync, etc.) at codesign time. Keeping this plist
  in the same directory means there is one obvious place to add them.
-->
